### Health check telemetry-service
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health

### Send valid telemetry -> expected 202 Accepted
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vin": "VF1RFB00123456789",
  "recordedAt": "2026-11-25T10:00:00Z",
  "mileageKm": 85000,
  "tirePressure": { "frontLeftBar": 2.3, "frontRightBar": 2.3, "rearLeftBar": 2.4, "rearRightBar": 2.4 },
  "batteryVoltage": 12.6,
  "engineTemperatureCelsius": 90,
  "fuelLevelPercent": 45,
  "errorCodes": ["P0300"]
}

### Missing VIN -> expected 400 Bad Request with field errors
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recordedAt": "2026-11-25T10:00:00Z",
  "mileageKm": 85000,
  "tirePressure": { "frontLeftBar": 2.3, "frontRightBar": 2.3, "rearLeftBar": 2.4, "rearRightBar": 2.4 },
  "batteryVoltage": 12.6,
  "engineTemperatureCelsius": 90,
  "fuelLevelPercent": 45
}

### Invalid VIN format -> expected 400 Bad Request (Invalid telemetry)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vin": "INVALID-VIN",
  "recordedAt": "2026-11-25T10:00:00Z",
  "mileageKm": 85000,
  "tirePressure": { "frontLeftBar": 2.3, "frontRightBar": 2.3, "rearLeftBar": 2.4, "rearRightBar": 2.4 },
  "batteryVoltage": 12.6,
  "engineTemperatureCelsius": 90,
  "fuelLevelPercent": 45
}
